menu "Core Pilot development options"

config CORE_PILOT_DEVELOPMENT_AUTH_BYPASS
    bool "Bypass HTTP bearer authentication for local hardware development"
    default n
    help
        Allows protected HTTP routes without a bearer token. Origin, Host, content-type,
        setup-mode, and input validation remain enforced. Enable only with the checked-in
        development sdkconfig defaults overlay on a physically controlled local network.
        Never enable this option in production or release firmware.

endmenu
